{"id": "34495", "title": "阿房", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34495.htm", "intro": "她，宫阿房，扫把一支，扫去了娘亲的康健、扫去了家中好运道、扫去了宫家惟一香火弟弟的宝贵性命!如今还扫到自个身上来，无端遇上这逃狱汉子，手腕被刺一刀没死成，人让他给掳到黑山堡，怪的是，这贼窝大当家的不做烧杀抢盗之事，尽卖力挥汗为家园，白天操劳不够晚上还操劳到她身上来，咚!发现她睡觉老滚下地，连人带被送回床是举手之劳，呜……她好生感动，扫把她一向是闲人勿近……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34495", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2188637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188642.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188643.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188644.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188645.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188646.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2188648.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2188649.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2188650.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2188651.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2188652.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2188653.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2188654.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2188655.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2188656.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2188657.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188658.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188659.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2188660.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2188661.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第26页", 